Today is Thursday.
It is evening now.
Our badminton game is finished.
We played at half past five.
I played well with Amit, Neha, and Sanjay.
Now I have come near the counter.
There is a racket in my hand.
This racket is not mine.
I took this racket on rent.
I give that racket to the worker.
"Madam, are you returning the racket?" he asks.
"Yes, I am returning it." I say.
"Thank you."
"How was the game today?" he asks.
"The game was very good." I answer.
Afterwards, I go near the court again.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay are waiting for me there.
"Maya, are you ready?" Neha asks.
"Yes, I am ready."
"Come, let us go." I say.
We all go outside together.
